{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isEmoji"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"text":"Bool","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property is true for scalars that are rendered as emoji by default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and also for scalars that have a non-default emoji rendering when followed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by U+FE0F VARIATION SELECTOR-16. This includes some scalars that are not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typically considered to be emoji:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = [\"😎\", \"$\", \"0\"]","for s in scalars {","    print(s, \"-->\", s.properties.isEmoji)","}","\/\/ 😎 --> true","\/\/ $ --> false","\/\/ 0 --> true"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The final result is true because the ASCII digits have non-default emoji"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentations; some platforms render these with an alternate appearance."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because of this behavior, testing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmoji"},{"type":"text","text":" alone on a single scalar is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"insufficient to determine if a unit of text is rendered as an emoji; a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"correct test requires inspecting multiple scalars in a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Character"},{"type":"text","text":". In"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"addition to checking whether the base scalar has "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmoji == true"},{"type":"text","text":", you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"must also check its default presentation (see "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isEmojiPresentation"},{"type":"text","text":") and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"determine whether it is followed by a variation selector that would modify"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presentation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This property corresponds to the “Emoji” property in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"http:\/\/www.unicode.org\/versions\/latest\/"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/Scalar\/Properties-swift.struct"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"isEmoji","platforms":[{"name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"8.0"},{"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"8.0"},{"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"10.10"},{"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"9.0"},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"2.0","name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"beta":false}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:s7UnicodeO6ScalarV10PropertiesV7isEmojiSbvp","modules":[{"name":"Standard Library"}